  "description": "Two-line karaoke caption: heavy Poppins capitals in white with a thin black edge, two balanced lines where the one being said stands larger than the other, and the word being said lit in colour (neon red, cyan or magenta by caption in Neon, yellow, green or red in Traffic light, one colour in the other presets). Emojis transcription suggested sit in a row above or below the caption, each coming in with a move of its own. Fast and punchy.",
